### Test Cart - Add Item
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/cart
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "PRODUCT_ID_HERE",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Get Cart with Summary
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/cart
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN

### Update Cart Item Quantity
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/users/cart/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Remove Item from Cart
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/users/cart/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN

### Clear Entire Cart
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/users/cart
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN

### ===== ADDRESS MANAGEMENT =====

### Get All Addresses
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/addresses
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN

### Add New Address
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users/addresses
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "addressLine1": "123 Main Street",
  "addressLine2": "Near Central Park",
  "city": "Mumbai",
  "state": "Maharashtra",
  "pincode": "400001",
  "country": "India",
  "isDefault": true
}

### Update Address
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/users/addresses/ADDRESS_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Smith",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "city": "Delhi"
}

### Set Default Address
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/users/addresses/ADDRESS_ID/default
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN

### Delete Address
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/users/addresses/ADDRESS_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN

### ===== ORDER MANAGEMENT =====

### Create Order (Checkout)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "product": "PRODUCT_ID_1",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "product": "PRODUCT_ID_2",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": {
    "fullName": "John Doe",
    "phone": "9876543210",
    "addressLine1": "123 Main Street",
    "addressLine2": "Near Central Park",
    "city": "Mumbai",
    "state": "Maharashtra",
    "pincode": "400001",
    "country": "India"
  },
  "paymentMethod": "COD",
  "itemsPrice": 29999,
  "shippingPrice": 0,
  "taxPrice": 5400,
  "totalPrice": 35399,
  "couponCode": ""
}

### Get My Orders
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/my-orders
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN

### Get My Orders with Filter (By Status)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/my-orders?status=Delivered
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN

### Get My Orders with Pagination
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/my-orders?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN

### Get Single Order Details
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN

### Cancel Order
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders/ORDER_ID/cancel
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Changed my mind"
}

### ===== SELLER ORDER MANAGEMENT =====

### Get Seller Orders
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/seller/orders
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SELLER_TOKEN

### Update Order Status (Seller/Admin)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders/ORDER_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SELLER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Processing",
  "comment": "Order is being prepared"
}

### Update Order Status to Shipped
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders/ORDER_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SELLER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Shipped",
  "comment": "Order shipped via express delivery"
}

### Update Order Status to Delivered
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders/ORDER_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SELLER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Delivered",
  "comment": "Order delivered successfully"
}

### ===== ADMIN ORDER MANAGEMENT =====

### Get All Orders (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

### Get Orders by Status (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

### Get Orders by Date Range (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-02-28
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

### Get Orders with Pagination (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

